{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01500",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 5.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.79,
      "end_seconds": 12.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.97,
      "end_seconds": 17.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "It's pain in the calf, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.56,
      "end_seconds": 21.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.9,
      "end_seconds": 35.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.23,
      "text": "Let me think, around three days... no wait, it's more like two days. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.15,
      "end_seconds": 42.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "does anything set it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.64,
      "end_seconds": 48.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "so, walking definitely sets it off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.47,
      "end_seconds": 52.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.12,
      "end_seconds": 78.21,
      "duration_seconds": 24.09,
      "text": "erm, when it starts I tend to get a bite mark on the shin as well as for bite mark on the shin, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.49,
      "end_seconds": 85.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "sure. Right, have you had pain in the calf before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.88,
      "end_seconds": 93.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 95.27,
      "end_seconds": 106.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.08,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Respiratory rate 22, oxygen saturation is 95 percent, pulse is 102 beats a minute, temperature 38.6, BP is 122 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.97,
      "end_seconds": 107.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.65,
      "end_seconds": 113.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.52,
      "end_seconds": 116.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.88,
      "end_seconds": 135.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "There is a warm, red, tender patch about ten centimetres across on the right shin with mild swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.06,
      "end_seconds": 146.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Nothing like red streaks up the leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.0,
      "end_seconds": 154.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "No, you know, I haven't had any red streaks up the leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.45,
      "end_seconds": 162.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Did you get breathlessness, chest pain or pus?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.73,
      "end_seconds": 168.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "I haven't had breathlessness, chest pain or pus, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.31,
      "end_seconds": 171.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.22,
      "end_seconds": 173.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.37,
      "end_seconds": 190.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.55,
      "end_seconds": 198.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "I, I had a meniscus repair on my knee four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.58,
      "end_seconds": 204.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.14,
      "end_seconds": 208.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.93,
      "end_seconds": 212.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.93,
      "end_seconds": 220.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.78,
      "end_seconds": 224.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.39,
      "end_seconds": 229.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.49,
      "end_seconds": 233.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.2,
      "end_seconds": 239.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.56,
      "end_seconds": 245.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.59,
      "end_seconds": 249.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.07,
      "end_seconds": 257.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "hm, okay yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.97,
      "end_seconds": 272.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Right, what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.17,
      "end_seconds": 278.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I take hydrochlorothiazide, 12.5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.77,
      "end_seconds": 301.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it fits best with cellulitis of the right leg. I'd also keep a deep vein thrombosis in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.98,
      "end_seconds": 305.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.34,
      "end_seconds": 319.47,
      "duration_seconds": 13.13,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with cellulitis of the right leg do well once it's treated properly. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with skin infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.82,
      "end_seconds": 323.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "When would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.95,
      "end_seconds": 341.66,
      "duration_seconds": 16.71,
      "text": "You'll be taking flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day, for seven days. You take it by mouth. That should help with cellulitis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.05,
      "end_seconds": 344.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.57,
      "end_seconds": 364.55,
      "duration_seconds": 17.98,
      "text": "mark the edge of the redness with a pen and keep the leg raised when sitting try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.99,
      "end_seconds": 374.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "Sure. I'd like you back if the redness spreads. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.32,
      "end_seconds": 382.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "well, thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    }
  ]
}